{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicMesaEquilibrium",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "description": "MOSAIC's MESA solid-liquid equilibrium of one size bin (WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F, mesa_ptc) STATED AS THE PROBLEM an EarthSciIntegrator bounded `solve` node solves (EarthSciIntegrator D95, PR #74): the fifteen solid salt amounts `Mesa.e_salt` are ALGEBRAIC UNKNOWNS, constrained by `0 ~ g` with g = mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm's `g` (S_s - 1 where MOSAIC lets the salt exchange, 0 where it does not), and its bound e_salt >= 0 (`lb`, esm 2.1.0) makes it the mixed complementarity problem e_salt >= 0, g <= 0, e_salt g = 0 -- the equilibrium mesa_ptc approaches by explicit pseudo-time steps. The residual is assembled from the state exactly as couplings/mosaic_mesa_salt_rates.esm assembles it (mass balance, ions_to_electrolytes, ZSR water, MTEM activities, mesa_salt_equilibrium); that document carries the tests, at visited and at converged states, because the Rust CLI does not evaluate a document with an implicit equation (`unsupported_construct`, checked on be1fafe6d, on EarthSciAST main 3e1f9bb2f and on main 4059a0b18, which carries #706 bounds but still has no route from `esm test` to a nonlinear solver; and on main aa8248719 built with EarthSciIntegrator 0.1.0, 2026-11-14, where `esm simulate --backend integrator --run-config mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.run.json` is refused the same way, because the CLI builds the array problem before handing over, and the integrator's planner itself still refuses algebraic operators and `solve` nodes until its M4b). This one is checked by `esm validate` (balanced: one array constraint for the one array algebraic unknown; on 4059a0b18 the `lb` is accepted and the only finding is the mounted mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm's unit `ng/m^3`, which the esm 2.0.0 flat unit table does not list). No solver is written here (CLAUDE.md): the run configuration that solves it is mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.run.json beside this file.\n\nSIGN AND PAIRING. The constraint is written `0 ~ g`, so its residual rhs - lhs is g, the pseudo-time rate of e_salt (EarthSciIntegrator run-config \u00a74.10: g_i paired with z_i, element by element over `salt`). A salt whose g is identically zero at the state (Ca(NO3)2, CaCl2, and the calcium switch-offs; every salt when the liquid has no water) is not moved by a pseudo-time step, so `ptc` keeps it at its warm start, which is MOSAIC's own behaviour: mesa_ptc starts every hand-off from no salt solid (do_full_deliquescence; checked on 2108 taped calls) and never moves such a salt. A semismooth `newton` would see a zero Jacobian row there, hence `ptc`.\n\nWHAT IS NOT AN UNKNOWN. CaSO4 and CaCO3 are insoluble: their solid comes with the bin (`elec_s_fixed`) and ions_to_electrolytes moves any new CaSO4 there; the acids and HHSO4 are never solid.\n\nEvery quantity carries the cell axes [lev, bin] (NLEV, NBIN, 1 by default) like the components it mounts, so this states the equilibrium of every size section of every grid cell at once; the bins are independent."
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Grid cells (model levels); 1 for a single cell."
    },
    "NBIN": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 1,
      "description": "MOSAIC size sections per cell; 1 for a single bin."
    },
    "NEL": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 22,
      "description": "MOSAIC electrolytes."
    },
    "NAER": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 112,
      "description": "MOSAIC aerosol species per bin (chem_opt = 170)."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NLEV"
    },
    "bin": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NBIN"
    },
    "el": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "solv": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "aer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NAER"
    },
    "salt": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 15
    },
    "sp": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 7
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "I2E": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/ions_to_electrolytes.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Zsr": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/aerosol_water_zsr.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Act": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mtem_activities.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Eq": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm",
      "bindings": {
        "NLEV": "NLEV",
        "NBIN": "NBIN"
      }
    },
    "Mesa": {
      "variables": {
        "t_k": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 298.0,
          "description": "Temperature.",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ]
        },
        "a_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.8,
          "description": "The bin's water activity ah2o_a (the Kelvin-lowered value aerosol_phase_state passes in), at which compute_activities' ZSR water is taken.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "aer_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total species aer(:, jtotal)."
        },
        "elec_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total electrolytes."
        },
        "log_gamz": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "el",
            "solv"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "MTEM binary log10 activity coefficients at the cell's relative humidity (mtem_binary_log_gamma.esm; mtem_compute_log_gamz runs once per MOSAIC call, at ah2o, not ah2o_a)."
        },
        "keq_hso4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/kg",
          "default": 0.01,
          "description": "Keq_ll(1) at the cell temperature.",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ]
        },
        "k_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol^2/kg^2",
          "default": 1e-14,
          "description": "Keq_ll(3), water's ion product.",
          "shape": [
            "lev"
          ]
        },
        "elec_s_fixed": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The solid electrolytes that are NOT unknowns of the equilibrium: CaSO4 and CaCO3 (insoluble, they come with the bin); zero for the acids and HHSO4, which are never solid. Its first fifteen entries (the salts) are not read."
        },
        "e_salt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "salt"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "lb": 0,
          "description": "THE UNKNOWNS: the solid amount of each of the fifteen soluble salts (electrolytes 1-15: (NH4)2SO4, (NH4)3H(SO4)2, NH4HSO4, NH4MSA, NH4NO3, NH4Cl, Na2SO4, Na3H(SO4)2, NaHSO4, NaMSA, NaNO3, NaCl, Ca(NO3)2, CaCl2, Ca(MSA)2). Algebraic: no equation defines it; `0 ~ g` constrains it, with the bound e_salt >= 0 declared here as `lb` (esm 2.1.0, EarthSciAST #706; EarthSciIntegrator #74 reads a solve unknown's bounds from the model, not the run configuration). Starting value 0, MOSAIC's (every hand-off starts with no salt solid)."
        },
        "elec_s": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "el"
          ],
          "description": "The solid electrolytes of the state: the unknowns for the fifteen salts, elec_s_fixed for the rest."
        },
        "g": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "salt"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The equilibrium residual paired with e_salt (coupled from Eq.g): S_s - 1 where MOSAIC lets the salt exchange, else 0."
        },
        "a_liq": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin",
            "sp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The liquid species as ions_to_electrolytes leaves them (coupled from I2E.a)."
        },
        "so4": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid sulfate handed to compute_activities.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "no3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid nitrate.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "cl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid chloride.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "nh4": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid ammonium.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "msa": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid MSA.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "na": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid sodium.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        },
        "ca": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid calcium.",
          "shape": [
            "lev",
            "bin"
          ]
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "elec_s",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b",
              "e"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              },
              "e": {
                "from": "el"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "<=",
                  "args": [
                    "e",
                    15
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "e_salt",
                    "k",
                    "b",
                    "e"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "elec_s_fixed",
                    "k",
                    "b",
                    "e"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": 0.0,
          "rhs": "g"
        },
        {
          "lhs": "so4",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "no3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                2
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "cl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                3
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "nh4",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                4
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "msa",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                5
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "na",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                6
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ca",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": [
              "k",
              "b"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "k": {
                "from": "lev"
              },
              "b": {
                "from": "bin"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "a_liq",
                "k",
                "b",
                7
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "coupling": [
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Eq.a_l_state",
      "to": "I2E.a_in",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the state's liquid by mass balance (totals less the solid's ions) into ions_to_electrolytes"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.a",
      "to": "Mesa.a_liq",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "ions_to_electrolytes' liquid (clipped, CaSO4 removed) back to the pass, to be handed on species by species"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.elec",
      "to": "Zsr.elec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the liquid electrolytes into the ZSR water (compute_activities' aerosol_water(jliquid))"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.a_w",
      "to": "Zsr.a_w",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the bin's water activity ah2o_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.aer_t",
      "to": "Zsr.aer_t",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the totals, for the kappa water of the non-electrolytes"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Zsr.water",
      "to": "Act.water",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the water the activities are molalities in"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.elec",
      "to": "Act.elec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the liquid electrolytes weight the MTEM mixing rule"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.so4",
      "to": "Act.so4",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid so4 into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.no3",
      "to": "Act.no3",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid no3 into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.cl",
      "to": "Act.cl",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid cl into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.nh4",
      "to": "Act.nh4",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid nh4 into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.msa",
      "to": "Act.msa",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid msa into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.na",
      "to": "Act.na",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid na into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.ca",
      "to": "Act.ca",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "liquid ca into compute_activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.log_gamz",
      "to": "Act.log_gamz",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "binary activity coefficients"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.keq_hso4",
      "to": "Act.keq_hso4",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "bisulfate dissociation constant"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.k_w",
      "to": "Act.k_w",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "water's ion product"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.t_k",
      "to": "Eq.t_k",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the pass's t_k"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.aer_t",
      "to": "Eq.aer_t",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the pass's aer_t"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.elec_t",
      "to": "Eq.elec_t",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the pass's elec_t"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Mesa.elec_s",
      "to": "Eq.elec_s",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the state: the unknowns with the fixed solids"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.a",
      "to": "Eq.a_l",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "ions_to_electrolytes' liquid"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.caso4",
      "to": "Eq.caso4",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the CaSO4 ions_to_electrolytes moved to the solid"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "I2E.elec",
      "to": "Eq.elec_l",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the liquid electrolytes"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Zsr.water",
      "to": "Eq.water",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the liquid water"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Act.activity",
      "to": "Eq.activity",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the electrolyte activities"
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Eq.g",
      "to": "Mesa.g",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "the equilibrium residual, constrained to zero (in complementarity with e_salt >= 0)"
    }
  ]
}
